{"id":"ec62883b7b82f77c","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-quantum-invariant.md","title":"Quantum Invariant","display":"df-quantum-invariant — Quantum Invariant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-quantum-invariant","aliases":["58-df-quantum-invariant"],"display":"df-quantum-invariant — Quantum Invariant","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-heegaard-floer.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-quantum-invariant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-quantum-invariant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantum-invariant — Quantum Invariant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34946ea21ee88f10\" href=\"?note=34946ea21ee88f10\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-heegaard-floer.md\">../batch01/58-df-heegaard-floer.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,M,G,r,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(z,M,G,r,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（闭定向三维流形原语）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompactConnectedSimpleLieGroup}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{CompactConnectedSimpleLieGroup}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（紧连通单 Lie 群原语）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AdmissibleLevel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{AdmissibleLevel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（可容许 level 原语）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuantumModularCategory}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{QuantumModularCategory}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,r\">\\(G,r\\)</span> 决定的量子模张量范畴值关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModularTensorCategory}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{ModularTensorCategory}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（模张量范畴原语）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RTInvariantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{RTInvariantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3\\mapsto1\">\\(S^3\\mapsto1\\)</span> 归一化的 Reshetikhin–Turaev 不变量值关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuantumInvariantValue}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{QuantumInvariantValue}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（此处定义的量子三流形不变量值关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}invariant}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{QuantumInvariantValue}_S(z,M,G,r)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{CompactConnectedSimpleLieGroup}_S(G)\n\\land\\operatorname{AdmissibleLevel}_S(r,G)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{QuantumModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,G,r)\n\\land\\operatorname{ModularTensorCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{RTInvariantValue}_S(z,M,\\mathcal C)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}invariant}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{QuantumInvariantValue}_S(z,M,G,r)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{CompactConnectedSimpleLieGroup}_S(G)\n\\land\\operatorname{AdmissibleLevel}_S(r,G)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{QuantumModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,G,r)\n\\land\\operatorname{ModularTensorCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{RTInvariantValue}_S(z,M,\\mathcal C)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>RT 构造由模张量范畴给出闭定向 3-流形不变量；具体根单位与 level 的移位依 Lie 型及约定而异。</li>\n<li>在采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3\\mapsto1\">\\(S^3\\mapsto1\\)</span> 的 RT 归一化时有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_r^{SU(2)}(S^3)=1\">\\(\\tau_r^{SU(2)}(S^3)=1\\)</span>；这是归一化的结果，不是量子不变量定义中的第二个独立断言。</li>\n<li>本书没有名为 <code>58-df-quantum-group</code> 的上游原子；本文件因此把所需的流形、Lie 群、level、模张量范畴与 RT 构造明确列为局部原始符号，而不保留悬空依赖。</li>\n<li>Witten 的 Chern–Simons 路径积分为 RT/WRT 不变量提供物理来源；“在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\to\\infty\">\\(r\\to\\infty\\)</span> 时二者相等”不是正确的定义陈述。</li>\n<li>Kirby move 不变性需要手术公式中的 framing anomaly 校正与规范化。</li>\n<li>原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RT}_S(M,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\operatorname{RT}_S(M,\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 名称像谓词却被当作函数值，且条件蕴含式不能完整定义部分项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_r^G(M)\">\\(\\tau_r^G(M)\\)</span>；现统一改为带输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的关系式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-heegaard-floer.md","status":"resolved","id":"34946ea21ee88f10","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-heegaard-floer.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"z,M,G,r,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompactConnectedSimpleLieGroup}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AdmissibleLevel}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuantumModularCategory}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"G,r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModularTensorCategory}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RTInvariantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"S^3\\mapsto1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuantumInvariantValue}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}invariant}\\vdash\n&\\mathrm{QuantumInvariantValue}_S(z,M,G,r)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\operatorname{ClosedOrientedThreeManifold}_S(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{CompactConnectedSimpleLieGroup}_S(G)\n\\land\\operatorname{AdmissibleLevel}_S(r,G)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{QuantumModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,G,r)\n\\land\\operatorname{ModularTensorCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{RTInvariantValue}_S(z,M,\\mathcal C)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S^3\\mapsto1","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_r^{SU(2)}(S^3)=1","display":false},{"tex":"r\\to\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RT}_S(M,\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_r^G(M)","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false}],"bytes":2466,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1024","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-quantum-invariant.md|58-df-quantum-invariant]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["34946ea21ee88f10"]}